GOAL.LOG: work log for the tasks in GOAL.TXT
============================================

Conventions
- Entries are in chronological order, grouped by task.
- "PR #n" / "issue #n" refer to https://github.com/pkolaczk/fclones.
- "Finding X" refers to an entry in CLAUDE_REVIEW.md (C1..C5, H1..H9, M1..M13, L1..L15).

Setup (2026-11-16)
- Working in a Docker container (passwordless sudo, isolated from the host).
  Installed: Rust stable 1.100.0 via rustup, build-essential, curl, git, jq.
- Base: a74f90d (fclones 0.35.0, origin = chtisgit/fclones fork of pkolaczk/fclones).
- All work happens on the new branch `consolidate-upstream`; main is untouched.
- Commit attribution policy:
  - Applied upstream PRs keep the original author as git author (cherry-pick of the
    original commits where possible); commit message references "upstream PR #n".
  - Corrections on top of a PR go in separate commits.
  - Own fixes: author Christian Fiedler, with a Co-Authored-By trailer for Claude.
- GitHub access: public REST API without login (60 requests/hour) and anonymous
  `git fetch` of pull/N/head refs. No gh CLI (it requires a login even for reads).

