PR #334 (David Taylor) - APPLIED as 5b910ae + own test commit.
- Read: new opt-in --ignore-xattr-errors flag threaded through run_script/execute/reflink; only
  PermissionDenied on individual xattr get/set/remove is skipped, everything else still fails.
  Only used on the non-Linux reflink path (macOS), Linux reflink keeps the inode and does not
